    "blurb": "Route customer messages to business services",
    "overview": "The AI Communication Agent receives customer messages across email, SMS, chat, and other channels, identifies the customer and their intent, and routes each request to the appropriate business service. Responses are delivered back through the customer's preferred channel, creating a consistent and coordinated experience across all touchpoints.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Add an AI engagement layer to your business services",
    "splashDescription": "Customer messages arrive from many places — email, SMS, chat, and more — and connecting those touchpoints to the right business service is a coordination challenge that only grows as AI takes on more customer-facing work. This blueprint provides an AI engagement layer that receives incoming messages across channels, identifies the customer and their intent, and routes each request to the appropriate business service. When the service responds, the agent delivers the reply through the customer's preferred channel. Use it as a reusable building block to expose any business process to AI-assisted, multichannel communication.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/808027/overview/img15306768265583167352.png?ad11cc703374086e298ba3cc29e9956c",
