      "description": "Uses LLM reasoning to interpret customer intent and dynamically route requests to the appropriate business service, enabling intelligent and context-aware interactions.",
      "hideOnOverview": false,
      "position": 2,
      "characteristics": []
    },
    {
      "id": "6526712",
      "refId": "bf2892d0-daea-4b3c-bb4b-948832f6140e",
      "header": "Integrate with existing business services",
      "description": "Use Camunda’s orchestration capabilities to integrate with existing business services to fulfill customer requests.",
